        "chapter": 52,
        "verse": 2
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JER",
          "chapter": 52,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "He did that which was evil in the LORD’s sight, according to all that Jehoiakim had done.",
      "ko": "시드기야가 여호야김의 모든 행위를 본받아 여호와 보시기에 악을 행한지라",
      "source_text_hash": "31d2e3e754bf1729ede2a1d817b2d4ca23c4726142200670341690f8f5b2a2fa",
      "translation_text_hash": "8e3c9b2068dd437eb41326f47b7d78ee9267418e04229edbf34a447ec68e7006",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "시드기야가 여호야김의 모든 행위를 본받아 여호와 보시기에 악을 행한지라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "8e3c9b2068dd437eb41326f47b7d78ee9267418e04229edbf34a447ec68e7006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:JER:52:3",
      "sequence": 20280,
      "chapter_label": "JER 52",
