        "verse": 9
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JER",
          "chapter": 52,
          "verse": 9
        }
      ],
      "en": "Then they took the king, and carried him up to the king of Babylon to Riblah in the land of Hamath; and he pronounced judgment on him.",
      "ko": "그들이 왕을 잡아가지고 하맛 땅 립나에 있는 바벨론 왕에게로 끌고 가매 그를 신문하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "68d1db21f2172a0850ee6786edb29d3d69353aa8a85048b067cfbd2159b4ed61",
      "translation_text_hash": "1b0edfd6252a5764ee1a20b22ad3650d2b72ec917b66f41a2eb4274889c0a800",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
