      "en": "Now in the fifth month, in the tenth day of the month, which was the nineteenth year of King Nebuchadnezzar, king of Babylon, Nebuzaradan the captain of the guard, who stood before the king of Babylon, came into Jerusalem.",
      "ko": "바벨론 왕 느부갓네살의 십 구년 오월 십일에 바벨론 왕의 어전 시위대 장관 느부사라단이 예루살렘에 이르러",
      "source_text_hash": "10d8bd29c9ad204e05867407a96d4805f14d8a1b4746c873f230da43fd49de7b",
      "translation_text_hash": "7775998f56ffa013c3f256e128392123efdb2bf6ac65dc322d34894bb33cfdff",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
