      "en": "A capital of bronze was on it; and the height of the one capital was five cubits, with network and pomegranates on the capital all around, all of bronze. The second pillar also had the same, with pomegranates.",
      "ko": "기둥 위에 놋머리가 있어 그 고가 다섯 규빗이요 머리 사면으로 돌아가며 꾸민 그물과 석류가 다 놋이며 또 다른 기둥에도 이런 모든 것과 석류가 있었으며",
      "source_text_hash": "5fe88a7da0077c5535c6280d098a6d0d465ba7b7228f2b39cfa7ec5a61d67b7e",
